            "review_title": "Review at Purple Log",
            "review_text": "Valeria F\n2 contributions\n0\nOne of my favourites in HCMC\nJul 2019 • Friends\nI've stayed in Ho Chi Minh City for a couple of months and I have lunch at Purple Log twice a week. It's a clean and tidy place, the food is delicious and the service is excellent! The staff is very polite and speaks English as well. Definitely one of my favourite places to eat in HCMC.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 11, 2019",
