            "review_text": "anna zuker\n6 contributions\n0\nIt was so good !!!\nDec 2018 • Couples\nIt taste so so good !!!\nThere are not a lot of customers when I go there but it's very very tasty. I bring vietnamese there and they said it was so good.\n\nOne day I had a delivery problem with them because the soup went out of the box. And I was surprise how well they answer and how they really take care of my problem and resolve it for my next delivery.\nI was thinking they will don't care and even not answer me at all.\n\nSo that's the best way to make a customer come again, so I continue to order my delivery food at Purple Log.\n\nThanks :)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 20, 2018",
